# Byte-exact transfer.
#
# These files are installed into Roblox Studio by hand, so what is checked out must be
# byte-identical to what was committed. Git's core.autocrlf rewrites line endings on
# checkout (Windows defaults to CRLF), which would silently change the byte count of
# every file. eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf and keeps the working tree identical to
# the blobs on every platform.
#
# Do not add a rule here that rewrites content.

* text=auto eol=lf

# No normalisation for anything that must stay byte-identical regardless of detection.
*.png binary
*.rbxl binary
*.rbxlx binary
*.rbxm binary
*.rbxmx binary

# Byte-exact install files whose line endings are part of the deliverable.
# `-text` disables Git's end-of-line normalisation for these paths, so the
# committed blob is exactly the file that INSTALL_MANIFEST.md hashes.
roblox/ReplicatedStorage/MinecraftShared/Collision.lua -text
roblox/ReplicatedStorage/MinecraftShared/InputState.lua -text
